iverside and Kingston.\\n\\nTHE ODYSSEY MIDNIGHT SCREENINGS\\nThe film will start promptly at 12:01am on Thursday night. Please ensure you are seated by midnight.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Christopher Nolan’s next film, The Odyssey, is a mythic action epic shot across the world using brand new IMAX® film technology. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong violence\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-17\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":172,\"trailers\":[{\"provider\":\"Moviexchange\",\"uri\":\"https://film-cdn.moviexchange.com/api/cdn/release/b3ff6b75-3025-43b7-88a5-37fc8c43d313/media/TrailerVideo\"},{\"provider\":\"External\",\"uri\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Sk6LZrA2JSQ\"}],\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Sk6LZrA2JSQ\",\"displayPriority\":3,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000319\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000680\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001061\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002220\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002609\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003850\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004443\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005731\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014094\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"actors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000319\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000680\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001061\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002220\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002609\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003850\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004443\"}],\"directors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005731\"}],\"producers\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005731\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014094\"}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"b